# Deploy after changes

When implementation is done, do not wait to be asked:

1. Commit the relevant files (no secrets, no `node_modules` / `dist`).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch.
3. End the reply with the EC2 update commands below.

```bash
cd ~/lotto
git pull
npm ci
npm run build
sudo rsync -a --delete dist/ /var/www/lottolab/
sudo chown -R www-data:www-data /var/www/lottolab
sudo systemctl reload nginx
```

Remote: `https://github.com/allzyy416/lotto`  
